		"en": [
			"• The \"Shoretrooper\" that appears in \"Rogue One: A Star Wars Story\" is now available in 1/12 Scale! Overall height approximately 157mm.",
			"• Three types of shore troopers can be selected (squad leader/captain/regular) using molded parts and decals.",
			"• The squad leader's skirt is made of cloth.",
			"• Two types of weapons are included: E-11 Blaster and E-22 Long Blaster."
		]
